positional arguments:
  {refresh,search,show,page,page-search,crawl,plan,download,inspect,verify}
    refresh             Refresh the complete study catalog
    search              Search studies
    show                Show one study by 3CA id
    page                Fetch any page under the 3CA site
    page-search         Search cached 3CA page text
    crawl               Cache all discoverable 3CA content pages
    plan                Inspect an asset before downloading
    download            Download a cataloged or discovered asset
